  "description": "This is a common recreational activity where people throw flat stones across water to make them skip or bounce. It is a harmless, innocent pastime often associated with childhood or leisure. The meme contrasts this with the more controversial act of smoking marijuana, using the juxtaposition to create humor. Understanding this activity is necessary to interpret the joke.",
